WEBVTT

00:13:59.379 --> 00:14:00.974
Pretty cramped up here,

00:14:01.824 --> 00:14:04.382
with seven million people beside me today.

00:14:04.823 --> 00:14:08.092
But if we don't act now, and act together,

00:14:08.116 --> 00:14:11.496
we'll need to make way
for one billion people

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:13.587
before the end of this century.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.365
And this is a very big stage.

00:14:16.841 --> 00:14:18.801
But there is no more room.

00:14:18.825 --> 00:14:19.992
Thank you.

00:14:20.016 --> 00:14:24.888
(Applause)